      "cooked": "<p>A hero turned villain.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-245-writers-room-virtuoso-of-the-void-vol-2-50\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-245-writers-room-virtuoso-of-the-void-vol-2-50\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/9a9dbe46c644d40585f2b2c15b4093a02ea2bdf1.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-245-writers-room-virtuoso-of-the-void-vol-2-50\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: Episode #245 - Writers' Room: Virtuoso of the Void Vol. 2 #50</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Someone's about to have a bad day!  Show Notes: Run Time: 1:35:25 The prompt for this episode was \"a hero turned villain\", and we start off by going through many instances of this in Sentinel Comics, before getting down to the business of...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/c80297b6201e9f527b7e6b785e4e76284c2ce912.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/c80297b6201e9f527b7e6b785e4e76284c2ce912\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c80297b6201e9f527b7e6b785e4e76284c2ce912_2_322x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"sxn31qvspPRIkzp3boEEobYTKrE\" width=\"322\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c80297b6201e9f527b7e6b785e4e76284c2ce912_2_322x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c80297b6201e9f527b7e6b785e4e76284c2ce912_2_483x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c80297b6201e9f527b7e6b785e4e76284c2ce912_2_644x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c80297b6201e9f527b7e6b785e4e76284c2ce912_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×2977 556 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
