      "id": 252081,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-04-11T18:34:34.447Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Okay, I definitely also forgot that Naturalist and Professor Pollution were an item before either of them was called either of those things!</p>\n<p>…Who? Is this a fictional writer talked about in the History book or something?</p>\n<p>Okay, I feel like I’m already getting a strong sense of what kind of person Guy Hampton is.</p>\n<p>The Diamond Diva? Oh, I hate her already. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"> But I do love how she looks like a combination of Emma Frost, Domino and Fox from Gargoyles.</p>\n<p>Oh man, finally some art of Tyranorak! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"> Wonder if he’ll get a deck in expansion 4.</p>\n<p>I’m kind of glad it was a corruption thing, caused by another hero, and not just “I’m trapped in the Void and for some reason, starting to see things from the Void monsters’ perspective.”</p>\n<p>Listening to this letter, I realize it’s something of a cop-out that they made a hero who crafted to make people angry in the first place. Her going villain was no doubt cathartic for some long-time Sentinels Comics readers.</p>\n<p>“Viscount of the Void”, that’s real good. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>Ah, the Principle of Graphic Design. Watch out for the major twist on that one!</p>\n<p>The censorship has been a good running gag. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"> This was a fun one!</p>",
